## Retention (recorded at setup)
A setup-time decision, not a per-unit one: what is kept forever vs regenerated on demand. The reasoning
is `campaign.md` §Decision record; the per-unit disk cost is `configs/loop.json`
`unit_cost.typical_disk_mb`, and the driver refuses to launch or halts below ~3 units of headroom. The
permanent record (save-set, snapshot, narrative, verdicts) is never in scope; only bulk artifacts whose
regeneration is deterministic and recorded may be dropped, with the user's confirmation.
